{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/b88a3afabe813912a8f08d9cc7abcdec.webp?t=1761139212\" width=615 height=45 /></span>Wacambria Island is a open-map, action RPG set on an island comprised of diverse biomes. Play as an adventurer whose search for treasure lands him in the middle of a drama between the local islanders and an invading army. With the island mostly controlled by the invading army, you will need to work together with the locals to gain back territory. This journey will take you across numerous biomes, caves, ruins and towns while discovering the secrets of an ancient power and a legendary hero. With the odds stacked against the local people, you will be the deciding factor of freedom in Wacambria Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Growing Resistance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1761139212\" width=615 height=5 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/231b810cf70287dddaf4f06460a6e88e.avif?t=1761139212\" width=614 height=180 /></span> Earn the trust of Wacambria Island's locals and turn passive bystanders into crucial allies in the fight for freedom. Their knowledge and support are vital to your quest. By helping them in their struggle against the invading army, you'll unlock new quests, earn valuable assistance, and shape the future of their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/263e6d8505a7a7045eda5000c0d0cf8b.webp?t=1761139212\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Sanctuary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1761139212\" width=615 height=5 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/66081d4c051c504979e5a30d6acf5a56.avif?t=1761139212\" width=614 height=180 /></span>Purchase one of many in-game homes and <strong>create your own personal sanctuary</strong>. Use a wide variety of materials, from a shopkeeper's wares to <strong>treasures found on your travels</strong>, to decorate your home to your heart\u2019s content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in Exciting Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1761139212\" width=615 height=5 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/3f6c703d210f5dab32d81d0876ede947.poster.avif?t=1761139212\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/3f6c703d210f5dab32d81d0876ede947.webm?t=1761139212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/3f6c703d210f5dab32d81d0876ede947.mp4?t=1761139212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in satisfying combat as you save Wacambria Island. Your <strong>enemies will strafe, parry and work together</strong> to try and stop your valiant efforts. Utilize the variety of weapons and tactics to bring your foes to their knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an Ancient World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1761139212\" width=615 height=5 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/00ebd228d7d879a142d4bc571a9ca7ff.poster.avif?t=1761139212\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/00ebd228d7d879a142d4bc571a9ca7ff.webm?t=1761139212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/00ebd228d7d879a142d4bc571a9ca7ff.mp4?t=1761139212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover the secret of Wacambria Island as you explore its sprawling landscape, including <strong>ruins, caves, temples and towns</strong>. Wacambria Island is packed with <strong>secrets, treasure and danger</strong> for a fearless adventurer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Adventurer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/05e32cd7ae5aab5b1570971c016d4d07.webp?t=1761139212\" width=615 height=5 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/7adadf7cc3d8b26d1ffa12095625f4be.poster.avif?t=1761139212\" width=614 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842680/extras/7adadf7cc3d8b26d1ffa12095625f4be.webm?t=1761139212\